  definitions.

Run-cost note (unchanged rail): performance is untimed by design (build
only). Full-ball sums S_i, S_j are mandatory (up to ~46k own-quad N_g per
(event, h, channel), cached per (channel, event, h)). An authorized
post-ratification smoke run (`--pairs-limit`) may time the pipeline; because
the band is locked at ratification, smoke values are part of the measurement
and may not trigger any band adjustment.

