## 12. Scope guard (imported from the D1 template, adapted)

- **No production posterior is produced.** The instrument reads frozen
  emits + catalogues; it re-runs no evaluate, writes nothing under
  `results/run_*`, `diagnostics/`, or `posteriors*` (path guard enforced in
  code).
- **No formula change is authorized.** REGARD routes to `/physics-change`
  with the full 5-item package; the `get_redshift_outer_bounds` code fact
  (§3) is flagged for adjudication, not changed.
- **Append-only after ratification.** Once the author ratifies and the file
  is committed (by the author's session, not this draft), thresholds are
  locked; any later change is an amendment visible as a diff.
- **Model/effort policy at readout:** mechanical extraction cheap; verdict
  interpretation + adversarial pass at high effort; the branch call is
  presented to the author, never self-adjudicated.

